    {
      "id": "2122527193461084396",
      "text": "Ott now challenging loose ball foul on Gillespie as Spencer Jones looked to chase down the ball and Gillespie was back on defense. Lost the challenge. Gillespie's shin was ruled to have hit Jones, but why even challenge they could've used it later in the game? #Suns",
