    {
      "id": "2122523002202206519",
      "text": "Booker and Green checking in for Brooks, Gillespie. Current lineup: Booker, Green, Kennard, Bridges and Ighodaro. Suns up 38-35. #Suns",
      "url": "https://x.com/DuaneRankin/status/2122523002202206519",
