    },
    {
      "id": "2122522650908209401",
      "text": "Could depth, the very thing that the Suns preached going into training camp, during training camp and early in the season, be the thing that turns around their season? Ighodaro in, Peat out. Quick minute, but again, this is a way get him in the game. Thoughts? #Suns",
      "url": "https://x.com/DuaneRankin/status/2122522650908209401",
      "published": "2026-11-17T02:50:09+00:00",
      "likes": 4,
      "author": "Duane Rankin",
      "handle": "DuaneRankin",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1570218502853922816/CqSaekV0_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122521761862541320",
      "text": "Earlier in the quarter, Brooks looked to feed Maluach again inside and Maluach mishandles pass. Happened vs. Lakers. In traffic, tough finds but those are feeds Maluach got to at least grab and look to finish. Suns are getting open looks against Denver's defense in the paint",
      "url": "https://x.com/DuaneRankin/status/2122521761862541320",
      "published": "2026-11-17T02:46:37+00:00",
      "likes": 4,
      "author": "Duane Rankin",
      "handle": "DuaneRankin",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1570218502853922816/CqSaekV0_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122521410073723284",
      "text": "The Peat addition gives Suns three bigs in essence. Peat is now playing the 5, which takes Bridges and Dunn out of that role when they're on the court with him. Current lineup: Gillespie, Kennard, Brooks, Bridges and Peat. Kennard 3, Suns up 35-30 with 8:19 left in half #Suns",
      "url": "https://x.com/DuaneRankin/status/2122521410073723284",
      "published": "2026-11-17T02:45:13+00:00",
      "likes": 19,
      "author": "Duane Rankin",
