      "id": "2122517787382018252",
      "text": "Dunn baseline drive, dunk, pose. Thumb must be OK. Goodwin scores of another cut for open layup. Again, these are the type of scores Phoenix can benefit from because the offense gets stagnant at times. That's at least three opportunities off cuts. Suns down 20-18. #Suns",
